## TSV schema

Paired A/B per cell, one row per cell:

| col | meaning |
|---|---|
| image | filename |
| corpus | "CID22" or "gb82-sc" |
| effort | e8 (all cells) |
| distance | f32 distance |
| role | one of: p1_target, w117_win, w118_canary, variantZ, w120_lowd, screen_d3, photo_d3 |
| mode_a_bytes | default (W44-117 one-shot seed) encoded byte count |
| mode_b_bytes | JXL_W44_RECON_DEEP_A4_PER_ITER_SHARPNESS=1 encoded byte count |
| delta_bytes_pct | 100 * (B - A) / A |
| mode_a_bfly | butteraugli (Rust crate) on mode A |
| mode_b_bfly | butteraugli (Rust crate) on mode B |
| delta_bfly_pct | 100 * (B - A) / A |
| mode_a_ssim2 | fast_ssim2 (Rust crate) on mode A |
| mode_b_ssim2 | fast_ssim2 on mode B |
| delta_ssim2 | absolute B - A |
| mode_a_ms | encode wall ms on mode A |
| mode_b_ms | encode wall ms on mode B |
| delta_ms_pct | 100 * (B - A) / A |

